"""
Life of Slime

You wake up to weird squishing sounds after that Truck came by doing a hundred in a school zone 
When you open your eyes, you find yourself in a cave. It's dark, at least it should be, but more importantly, why can't you feel your body? 
I guess now is time to experience the Life of Slime!
"""

